⚠️ If Specific Permissions Are Expected
If the validator expects particular actions in the policy document (e.g., S3 read access, EC2 full access), replace the Action list accordingly. The task only specifies the name, so the policy content is flexible — but a valid statement is mandatory for the policy to be created.
